{"html": "<section class=\"ec-product-scenarios ec-library-detail-section\" id=\"product-use-scenarios\" data-scene-ver=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"product-scenario-title\"><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">用途与选型</p><h2 id=\"product-scenario-title\">适用场景建议</h2><p class=\"ec-scenario-role\">1.4 LPS 扎壶 / 分酒壶</p><div class=\"ec-scenario-grid\"><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/backyard-bbq-cups/\">后院烧烤 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>1.4 L PS壶身，带盖与壶嘴。一壶分一圈，不用来回跑厨房。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/open-air-nightclub/\">户外酒吧 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>吧台后先调好一壶，出杯时直接倒，速度快一倍。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/tailgate-party-cups/\">尾箱与汽车派对 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>盖子扣紧放后备箱，路上不洒。</p></article></div><div class=\"ec-scenario-check\"><h3>项目确认</h3><p>核对长桌摆位、多人轮次与清洗条件；出杯速度、叠放收纳与夜间照明条件；场地容器规定、单杯份量与车载携带方式。</p></div><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">以上为选型建议。请按实际用途审核所选配置与样品。</p><a class=\"ec-scenario-cta\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=PJB-012\">讨论 PJB-012 的应用方案 →</a></section>", "kind": "product"}